## 当前唯一真正承重的开放桥

$$
\boxed{
\text{从 toric relative trace formula
构造一个 conservative realization of }\Theta_\omega
\quad
(\forall\omega>0).
}
$$

等价弱形式为：

$$
\boxed{
\frac{
1-
\Theta_\omega(z)\overline{\Theta_\omega(w)}
}{
1-z\overline w
}
=
\langle
\mathscr X_{\omega,z}^{\mathrm{tor}},
\mathscr X_{\omega,w}^{\mathrm{tor}}
\rangle.
}
$$

